5,1,1,talk,Servas,,I shall begin. I am concerned with the human element; I will examine the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I would like to understand the current financial burdens. I'll look into the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and the national repository deposit turnaround.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I want to see how the shared tools are doing! I'll check the national computing agreement and facility day rates, and the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I am interested in where the friction lies. I will review the incident logs on shared instrumentation and the portfolio review of schedule overruns.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I will look at the closeout files of finished awards and the station records from partner field sites.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
